{
  "about": "The URL rules a server layer for an embed build follows (docs/server.md), as the browser runtime applies them (src/runtime/url.ts is the reference). `params`: `$url` from a page request's path and query, the `:name` segments of the first pattern that matches (a string, or a list for an array parameter); `expand`: a placeholder's `src` filled from `$url` (null: refused, a path value of `.` or `..` or a list); `withParams`: query parameters set on a URL, as a paginated resource's page; `described`: the request the build describes for a placeholder (its `when`, its first page); `when`: whether a placeholder's `when` holds; `match`: the first rule in order for a path (`exact`: a redirect, for exactly its path; else a page's path or a rewrite, by its non-empty segments, `:name` any one); `escape`: the JSON written into a placeholder. Run by test/server/cases.test.ts (@tiaforge-ui/sinter/server), packages/sinter-axum (src/lib.rs, `shared_cases`) and packages/sinter-aspnetcore (test/Sinter.AspNetCore.Tests/ServerCasesTests.cs).",
